					</linkFB>
					<linkFB>
						<linkSource parentObjectName=".4" pinName="OUT">
							<objPosition posX="12" posY="22"></objPosition>
						</linkSource>
						<linkDestination parentObjectName=".8" pinName="IN">
							<objPosition posX="20" posY="22"></objPosition>
						</linkDestination>
					</linkFB>
					<textBox width="12" height="4">Set ShiftRegister "seed" value based on current time
    <objPosition posX="2" posY="12"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="16" height="4">Only set the Shift Register value on first scan.
    <objPosition posX="120" posY="13"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="20" height="10">Random Number Generator
-------------------------------------------
XOR certain bits in the Shift Register and then shift the register left by 1. Now replace the XORed bit with Bit 0.
    <objPosition posX="35" posY="28"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="20" height="3">Calculate the Random Number using the Upper and Lower limit to scale the value.
    <objPosition posX="26" posY="71"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="10" height="6">Added in logic to avoid arithmetic error with UINT datatype overflow
    <objPosition posX="35" posY="12"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
				</networkFBD>
			</FBDSource>
		</FBProgram>
	</FBSource>
</FBExchangeFile>
